1
00:00:45,940 --> 00:00:49,500
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:51,260
=Episode 5=

3
00:00:56,479 --> 00:00:58,520
That technique of yours is amazing.

4
00:00:58,640 --> 00:00:59,799
What else can you produce?

5
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:03,320
I can produce anything.

6
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:06,640
The Wind God Chronicle is born
of the Wind God's power.

7
00:01:06,920 --> 00:01:07,959
No talismans needed.

8
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:08,799
Just speak the spell.

9
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,640
That's so cool!

10
00:01:11,079 --> 00:01:13,280
When you have time, teach me!

11
00:01:13,719 --> 00:01:15,120
This art is divinely bestowed.

12
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:16,239
It can't be passed on.

13
00:01:17,079 --> 00:01:20,040
Stingy!
Just say you don't want to teach.

14
00:01:21,519 --> 00:01:24,599
Your master said
you're stuck at some bottleneck.

15
00:01:25,079 --> 00:01:26,560
Is it those mirrors?

16
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:29,760
How do you know that?

17
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,439
What did you see?

18
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:33,920
Nothing much.

19
00:01:34,359 --> 00:01:36,599
Just a woman.

20
00:01:39,159 --> 00:01:41,400
Is she your beloved?

21
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:44,319
Hey, I am asking you.

22
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:47,439
Ignoring me again? Boring.

23
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:50,560
(You're my beloved one.)

24
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:52,760
(You're not as terrible as I thought.)

25
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:54,590
(Somehow,)

26
00:01:55,310 --> 00:01:57,680
(it'd be a shame to eat you now.)

27
00:02:01,319 --> 00:02:02,840
So who is she?

28
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:04,840
Do you like her?

29
00:02:05,599 --> 00:02:07,680
Where is she? What is her name?

30
00:02:09,759 --> 00:02:11,960
Still ignoring me.

31
00:02:12,599 --> 00:02:12,960
Fine.

32
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:15,159
I guess a Taoist like you
wouldn't know love anyway.

33
00:02:15,599 --> 00:02:19,240
Today, I'll teach you
the most powerful spell.

34
00:02:19,479 --> 00:02:21,319
One strike can conquer all.

35
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:24,639
One strike to conquer all?

36
00:02:25,759 --> 00:02:27,439
I've never heard of such a spell.

37
00:02:28,919 --> 00:02:30,159
The word "love"

38
00:02:30,439 --> 00:02:32,039
is the most powerful spell.

39
00:02:32,719 --> 00:02:34,439
Whether it's heaven
standing in your way,

40
00:02:34,439 --> 00:02:35,719
or every human and demon against you,

41
00:02:35,719 --> 00:02:39,039
if you shout it out, scream it out,
let it out loud,

42
00:02:39,639 --> 00:02:41,680
that one strike can conquer all.

43
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,360
But I...

44
00:02:46,639 --> 00:02:47,360
But what?

45
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:48,280
But... But...

46
00:02:48,439 --> 00:02:49,560
If you don't speak up,

47
00:02:49,599 --> 00:02:51,400
nothing will ever happen.

48
00:02:51,639 --> 00:02:54,120
What, are you waiting for her
to fall from the sky

49
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,439
and land right in your arms?

50
00:02:58,150 --> 00:02:59,150
(What if)

51
00:02:59,750 --> 00:03:01,280
(she really did fall from the sky?)

52
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:29,199
(In this forest...)

53
00:03:29,590 --> 00:03:31,840
(why is there such sorrowful
demonic energy?)

54
00:04:01,919 --> 00:04:03,759
A little demoness

55
00:04:04,319 --> 00:04:07,680
and a young Taoist.

56
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:13,240
What a lovely pair!

57
00:04:14,919 --> 00:04:16,120
Little demoness,

58
00:04:16,759 --> 00:04:21,480
let me tell you a story.

59
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:40,510
(Joy Spider, you carry
the Five-Colored Silk.)

60
00:04:40,630 --> 00:04:42,040
(You must beware of humans.)

61
00:04:42,310 --> 00:04:43,800
(Their greed knows no bounds.)

62
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:45,920
(They'll skin you alive for your silk.)

63
00:04:46,830 --> 00:04:49,920
(Beware of humans.
Especially the handsome ones.)

64
00:05:08,399 --> 00:05:09,199
Miss.

65
00:05:21,959 --> 00:05:23,600
I came to the mountains to paint.

66
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,720
I was so captivated by your beauty

67
00:05:26,079 --> 00:05:27,560
that I painted you.

68
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:30,639
Please don't be upset.

69
00:05:33,399 --> 00:05:35,639
I'm not. I love it.

70
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:38,160
If I may be so bold,

71
00:05:38,639 --> 00:05:40,680
I see you're all alone,

72
00:05:42,079 --> 00:05:44,040
and a seesaw is no fun by yourself.

73
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:46,839
May I join you?

74
00:05:50,279 --> 00:05:50,959
Yes.

75
00:06:17,199 --> 00:06:19,759
Darling, how do I look in this?

76
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:24,519
It's beautiful.

77
00:06:25,279 --> 00:06:26,079
So beautiful.

78
00:06:27,079 --> 00:06:29,040
Darling, I'm a demon.

79
00:06:29,439 --> 00:06:30,800
Are you truly not afraid?

80
00:06:35,399 --> 00:06:36,199
I am not.

81
00:06:37,079 --> 00:06:38,600
Whether you're human or demon,

82
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:42,519
it is you whom I love.

83
00:06:43,439 --> 00:06:45,040
If my true form is exposed

84
00:06:45,759 --> 00:06:47,720
and the world rejects me, what then?

85
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:54,160
The world doesn't know your worth.

86
00:06:55,319 --> 00:06:56,639
That's their loss.

87
00:06:57,639 --> 00:06:59,879
If this place won't have us,

88
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:02,560
I'll take your hand

89
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:04,879
and wander the world.

90
00:07:05,879 --> 00:07:07,600
There will always be a place for us.

91
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,240
This life is fleeting,

92
00:07:11,399 --> 00:07:12,600
but my love for you will never fade.

93
00:07:15,199 --> 00:07:16,000
Truly?

94
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:25,399
Truly.

95
00:07:43,639 --> 00:07:44,759
This Five-Colored Silk

96
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:46,600
is woven from my Demon Essence.

97
00:07:46,959 --> 00:07:49,120
Only one strand a year.

98
00:07:50,079 --> 00:07:52,399
Darling, every year from now on,

99
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:54,839
I'll weave you a garment

100
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:57,319
with my Demon Essence
and blood as thread.

101
00:07:58,279 --> 00:07:59,519
May we

102
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,639
be together forever.

103
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:07,720
Honey!

104
00:08:08,639 --> 00:08:09,439
Honey!

105
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:11,439
Run away!

106
00:08:11,759 --> 00:08:13,279
What is wrong?

107
00:08:13,399 --> 00:08:15,199
Some Taoists are coming to hunt demons.

108
00:08:15,399 --> 00:08:16,240
You need to leave.

109
00:08:16,279 --> 00:08:17,079
What about you?

110
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,399
I've already married you.

111
00:08:18,759 --> 00:08:19,560
I've broken their rules.

112
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:21,000
Go! I'll hold them off.

113
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:22,519
They won't do much to me.

114
00:08:22,839 --> 00:08:23,680
No!

115
00:08:23,959 --> 00:08:25,199
I won't leave you.

116
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:29,600
Demon, die!

117
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:30,399
Come at me!

118
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,480
Don't hurt my husband!

119
00:08:44,879 --> 00:08:45,679
Honey!

120
00:08:49,279 --> 00:08:50,080
Darling!

121
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,840
Are you hurt?

122
00:08:53,519 --> 00:08:55,440
I'm fine.

123
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:57,519
Are you hurt?

124
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,360
I am fine.

125
00:08:59,879 --> 00:09:00,879
Are your

126
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:03,440
skin and threads harmed?

127
00:09:25,679 --> 00:09:26,639
Look! Look!

128
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:29,039
This is a demon!

129
00:09:29,159 --> 00:09:30,200
Get out of our village!

130
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,360
Demons deserve to die!

131
00:09:31,679 --> 00:09:32,480
Serves her right!

132
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:34,240
The silks of the Wrath-Peak Spider

133
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:36,000
cannot be burned or soaked.

134
00:09:36,519 --> 00:09:37,480
It shimmers in five colors.

135
00:09:38,039 --> 00:09:39,559
Woven into clothing,

136
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:42,159
it will never fade or rot
for ten thousand years.

137
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,200
Now that you're frozen,

138
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:47,039
I can draw silk from you endlessly.

139
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:56,559
Your threads of love

140
00:09:57,440 --> 00:10:00,960
have woven the road to my success.

141
00:10:02,279 --> 00:10:03,480
Did you ever,

142
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:07,320
even for a moment,

143
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:10,879
truly love me?

144
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:26,799
Of course I did.

145
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:33,399
Your love was the finest silk of all.

146
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:35,759
From now on,

147
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:38,879
I'll never have to endure

148
00:10:38,879 --> 00:10:41,919
that disgusting demon stench of yours.

149
00:10:52,879 --> 00:10:55,000
Then I have no regrets.

150
00:11:07,639 --> 00:11:09,120
What... what is this?

151
00:11:10,679 --> 00:11:11,039
This...

152
00:11:12,399 --> 00:11:13,559
Help!

153
00:11:13,799 --> 00:11:16,440
The demon is eating people!

154
00:11:21,159 --> 00:11:21,960
Help!

155
00:11:23,519 --> 00:11:25,320
Help!

156
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:32,559
Run! Run!

157
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:35,039
Help!

158
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:36,759
Help!

159
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:38,399
Run! There is a demon!

160
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:43,159
Run!

161
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:51,639
In this mortal world,

162
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:57,200
no man will ever truly love a demoness.

163
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:59,360
(Love is a blade.)

164
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,480
(The cruelest of all.)

165
00:12:02,510 --> 00:12:04,030
(Only by loving yourself)

166
00:12:04,630 --> 00:12:08,390
(can you survive in this world.)

167
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:17,000
Where are we?

168
00:12:18,279 --> 00:12:19,039
You are awake.

169
00:12:21,039 --> 00:12:21,879
I just...

170
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:25,399
had a very strange dream.

171
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:27,080
What dream?

172
00:12:32,759 --> 00:12:37,320
Thank you
for giving me a beautiful dream.

173
00:12:38,870 --> 00:12:40,270
(In the end,
humans and demons are different.)

174
00:12:40,910 --> 00:12:41,790
(From now on,)

175
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:45,000
(I will never miss another chance
to kill you.)

176
00:12:45,759 --> 00:12:46,559
Is that so?

177
00:12:47,519 --> 00:12:52,360
Then I hope you have beautiful dreams
every day.

178
00:12:55,910 --> 00:12:58,390
(And you will never become
my nightmare again.)

179
00:13:22,780 --> 00:13:26,680
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

180
00:13:26,860 --> 00:13:29,730
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

181
00:13:30,250 --> 00:13:33,840
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

182
00:13:33,840 --> 00:13:36,980
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

183
00:13:36,980 --> 00:13:40,160
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

184
00:13:44,515 --> 00:13:48,400
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

185
00:13:52,100 --> 00:13:55,820
♪Let towering waves come crashing down;
I'll fight against the tide♪

186
00:13:55,820 --> 00:13:59,580
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

187
00:13:59,580 --> 00:14:03,680
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
